    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56960" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέστρος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sharpness</i> or <i>roughness on
				the tongue</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>first sprout of seeds</i>, Id. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bolt discharged from engines</i>, invented in the war with
			Perseus, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				27.11.1
			</span></i> (s.v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				20.1
			</span></i>.</div>
